    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I genuinely enjoy math, especially when it connects to real-world problems. It’s like solving puzzles, and I find satisfaction in discovering a pattern or proving something. I’ve always been drawn to computer science and proofs, which are heavily mathematical. Even in photography, math helps with composition and lens calculations. It’s a subject I see as both fun and useful.",
